Zynga has partnered with UK pet charity Blue Cross on a new Farmville 2: Country Escape event that will see players work towards a real-world donation goal through in-game activities.&nbsp;

Running from October 14 to November 10, the Pet Pals event tasks players with caring for virtual guinea pigs. Players do this by earning and feeding them nibbles which can be earned by completing farm activities, each nibble then contributes to a shared progress bar.&nbsp; ... [<a href="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/zynga-launches-farmville-2-charity-event-with-blue-cross/">MORE</a>]
