Supercell will shut down Squad Busters on December 14th, 2026, ending the game&rsquo;s run after its global launch in May 2024.&nbsp;

The game will be removed from the App Store and Google Play on December 1st, but players who already have it installed can keep playing until the servers permanently shut down two weeks later.&nbsp; ... [<a href="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/supercell-set-to-shut-down-squad-busters-on-december-14th/">MORE</a>]
